# --- public-repo exclusions (2026-09-12) ---
# Raw downloaded deposits: large, re-downloadable from the GEO accessions in
# DATASET_MANIFEST.tsv, and not the "source data" the availability statement promises.
data/
# Third-party material (a published preprint PDF) and working research notes.
sources/
# Internal claim-artifact audit: never upload or publish.
AUDIT_*/
# Build artifact of the editable install.
pgaa.egg-info/
# Harness-side resource index; unrelated to the software release.
.claude_resources.json

# --- article content: kept on disk, never pushed (2026-09-12) ---
# The manuscript, its figures and their source-data tables, and the frozen
# submission packages for earlier journals. The availability statement promises
# code and build scripts from this repository; the article itself is not hosted
# here. Removing these from the index does not delete them locally -- the PDF
# build and the submission archive still read them from the working tree.
MANUSCRIPT.md
SUPPLEMENTARY.md
figures_png/
figure_source_data/
COMMUNICATIONS_MEDICINE_TRANSFER/
COMMUNICATIONS_AI_COMPUTING_TRANSFER/
